#: templates/dashboard/lan_events.html:18
msgid ""
"What the fabric sensor hears on the peering LAN. Neighbor-discovery "
"anomalies: a new MAC appearing on an existing IP, or a single MAC claiming "
"many IPs (proxy-ARP); events tagged “reflection” are benign re-flooding "
"after a fabric flap. LAN-hygiene detections: a participant MAC sourcing a "
"protocol that does not belong on an exchange (IPv6 router advertisements, "
"DHCP, IGP hellos, discovery protocols…), toned by severity, with the fix."
msgstr ""
"What the lookout in the crow's nest hears on the peerin' LAN. Neighbour-"
"discovery oddities: a new MAC turnin' up on an IP already spoken for, or one"
" MAC layin' claim to a heap o' IPs (proxy-ARP); happenin's marked "
"“reflection” be harmless echoes after the fabric took a tumble. LAN-hygiene "
"sightin's: a crew's MAC flyin' a protocol that's got no business on an "
"exchange (IPv6 router advertisements, DHCP, IGP hellos, discovery "
"protocols…), coloured by how dire it be, with the remedy."

