#: templates/dashboard/route_server_parity.html:14
msgid ""
"SFMIX runs two route servers (BIRD and OpenBGPD) for redundancy, and peering"
" with both is required so that a single route-server failure never cuts a "
"network off. Networks that are not established on both servers — or whose "
"received-prefix counts disagree — are listed first."
msgstr ""
"SFMIX sails two route servers (BIRD an' OpenBGPD) for backup, an' ye must "
"parlay with both, so a single route server goin' under never maroons 'yer "
"network. Networks not established on both — or whose received-prefix tallies"
" disagree — be listed first."

